  "cil_liability": true,
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: normal;&quot;&gt;The proposal, by reason of its low Public Transport Accessibility Level (PTAL) rating and the original internal floor area of the existing dwelling being less than 130sqm, would have a detrimental impact on the character, stock of family sized housing and amenity of local areas, contrary to HO2 of the Harrow Local Plan (2021-2041).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: normal;&quot;&gt;The proposed two-storey side extension, due to its size, width, design and prominent position, would appear out of keeping with the host dwelling and surrounding properties, resulting in a visually intrusive form of development that would harm the character and appearance of the street scene, contrary to the high quality design aspirations of the National Planning Policy Framework (2026), Policy D3 of the London Plan (2021), Policy GR1 of Harrow’s Local Plan (2021-2041) and the adopted Supplementary Planning Document: Residential Design Guide (2010).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: normal;&quot;&gt;The proposal, by reason of the inadequate and poorly subdivided private amenity space, would provide a substandard living environment for future occupiers. The resulting fragmented rear garden and excessive enclosure would appear out of keeping with the character and established pattern of development in the area, to the detriment of local character and residential amenity, contrary to the National Planning Policy Framework (2026), policies D3 and D6 of The London Plan (2021), Policy GR1 of Harrow’s Local Plan (2021-2041) and the adopted Supplementary Planning Document: Residential Design Guide (2010).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ]
}